Pasting the access section from our design for the "Harbor" shipping-manifest portal. Looking for any problems we haven't spotted. We already know about the items in our own list.

**Roles in the system**
| Role | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| PortalWebRole | Serves the web UI |
| ManifestIngestRole | Loads manifests from partners |
| AuditorReadRole | Read-only access for auditors |
| BillingSyncRole | Syncs charges to finance system |
| PlatformAdminRole | Manages infrastructure |

**Definition of ManifestIngestRole (only one defined so far):**
```ts
const ingestRole = new iam.Role(this, 'ManifestIngestRole', {
  assumedBy: new iam.AccountPrincipal('123456789012'), // partner account
});
ingestRole.addToPolicy(new iam.PolicyStatement({
  actions: ['firehose:PutRecord'],
  resources: ['arn:aws:firehose:eu-west-1:111122223333:deliverystream/manifests-in'],
}));
ingestRole.addToPolicy(new iam.PolicyStatement({
  actions: ['sqs:*'],
  resources: ['*'],
}));
```
The sqs statement was added by a former dev; the ticket just says "queue stuff".

**Our known issues list (Compliance Gaps Identified)**
1. No MFA on PlatformAdminRole console login: tracked, due next sprint.
2. Manifest data is not yet covered by a retention policy: tracked.
3. Incident response plan not written: tracked.

**Next steps:** enable MFA, write retention policy, draft IR plan.

Also note PlatformAdminRole will probably need broad IAM rights, so we'll want to lock that down properly later.

Hi, we're about to take card payments in our boutique booking platform and I need to sign off. Our dev pasted this summary. Can you tell me what stands in the way?

- Card tokens and last-4 digits are stored in an RDS Postgres instance. The Terraform has no encryption setting at all, so defaults.
- Web tier and database share one subnet and one security group that allows port 5432 from 0.0.0.0/0 (needed for the reporting vendor).
- The reporting vendor (account 123456789012) uses this role:

```ts
new iam.Role(this, 'ReportingRole', {
  assumedBy: new iam.AccountPrincipal('123456789012'),
  inlinePolicies: {
    p: new iam.PolicyDocument({ statements: [
      new iam.PolicyStatement({ actions: ['rds:*'], resources: ['*'] }),
    ]}),
  },
});
```

- Audit trail: one trail in eu-west-1, log validation off, logs kept 30 days.
- No alarms configured.

We're in the EU but customers pay from all over the world.
